[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mService is done. Takes 10 seconds to start: warms a cache, opens a pool, reads\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mconfig.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAfter that it flies.\u001b[39m\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mGot a probe?\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mCopied one out of an article. It was right there in the example.\u001b[39m\u001b[19X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?2026l"]
