[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;13H\u001b[1K\u001b[ClivenessProbe:\u001b[76X\u001b[3;15H\u001b[1K\u001b[ChttpGet: { path: /healthz, port: 8080 }\u001b[49X\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[12X\u001b[12CinitialDelaySeconds: 2\u001b[39m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[32m+\u001b[12X\u001b[12CinitialDelaySeconds: 12\u001b[39m\u001b[65X\u001b[6;15H\u001b[1K\u001b[CperiodSeconds: 1\u001b[72X\u001b[7;15H\u001b[1K\u001b[CtimeoutSeconds: 1\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwelve is bigger than ten. We are done here.\u001b[39m\u001b[39X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhat if the start gets slower?\u001b[39m\u001b[53X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhy would it?\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[11;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ envsubst < k8s/incident1/11-liveness-initialdelay.yaml | kubectl apply -f -\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24X\r\n  deployment.apps/svc configured\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt holds because nothing changed. Not because the number is right.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt holds because the number is right.\u001b[39m\u001b[46X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m+ pod up (1s)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[88X\u001b[17;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo get pods "]
[0.000, "o", "-l app=svc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\r\n  NAME\u001b[19X\u001b[19CREADY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\u001b[46X\r\n  svc-6bcc9bb9d9-8m9gp   1/1     Running   0\u001b[10X\u001b[10C11s\u001b[46X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mGreen. Told you.\u001b[39m\u001b[67X\u001b[22;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mA week passes. Timur ships a feature.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mCatalogue is preloaded now. /work used to fetch it on every request; it reads it\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37monce at boot instead.\u001b[39m\u001b[74X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mRequests got faster, then.\u001b[39m\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwice as fast. Boot pays for it.\u001b[39m\u001b[51X\u001b[28;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mWARMUP_SECONDS  10 -> 20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne more thing to do before the port opens. I did not go near the probe.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\u001b[31;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo set env deploy/svc WARMUP_SECONDS=20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47X\r\n  deployment.apps/svc env updated\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ru"]
[0.001, "o", "slan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI did not touch the probe either.\u001b[39m\u001b[50X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNobody did. The service grew underneath it.\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[37m[o_o] kubelet\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwelve seconds gone. Asking: are you alive?\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\u001b[37;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mTwo numbers are racing. Patience runs out at fifteen seconds. The service is ready at twenty.\u001b[39m        \u001b[39;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2msame manifest, slower environment\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\r\n  \u001b[2mready \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . restarts \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[69X\r\n  \u001b[1m 25s\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[2m░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[2mlet it run . [->] skips\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[18X\r\n  svc-55b77b7f5b-k6l6m\u001b[11X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\u001b[11C1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
