[0.000, "o", "d at all.\u001b[39m         \r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mSo the start gets its own time budget?\u001b[39m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIts own. Two minutes if it wants. It does not affect the liveness period.\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd liveness goes back to what it was for. The initialDelay comes out, the\u001b[39m         \r\n        \u001b[37mperiod goes back to five.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[42;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mWARMUP_SECONDS  10 -> 20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
