[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mWARMUP_SECONDS  10 -> 20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne more thing to do before the port opens. I did not go near the probe.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\u001b[4;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo set env deploy/svc WARMUP_SECONDS=20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47X\r\n  deployment.apps/svc env updated\u001b[70X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI did not touch the probe either.\u001b[39m\u001b[50X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNobody did. The service grew underneath it.\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[37m[o_o] kubelet\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwelve seconds gone. Asking: are you alive?\u001b[39m\u001b[40X\u001b[10;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mTwo numbers are racing. Patience runs out at fifteen seconds. The service is ready at twenty.\u001b[39m        \u001b[12;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2msame manifest, slower environment\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\r\n  \u001b[2mready \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . restarts \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[69X\r\n  \u001b[1m  6s\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m█████████████████"]
[0.000, "o", "██████████████████████\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m░░░░░░░░░░░░░\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[2mlet it run . [->] skips\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[18X\r\n  svc-55b77b7f5b-k6l6m\u001b[11X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\u001b[11C1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:1\u001b[45X\u001b[17;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\r\n  initialDelaySeconds is a bet that tomorrow looks like today.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41X\u001b[31m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[21;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m...You did ask what happens if the start gets slower.\u001b[39m\u001b[30X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mI did.\u001b[39m\u001b[77X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA cold cache. A noisier neighbour. A bigger dataset. One more step at boot.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNone of those touch the manifest, and every one of them mov"]
[0.000, "o", "es the start.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery other number in a probe reacts to something the process did. This one only\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mcounts.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt cannot tell a slow start from a dead process, because it is not looking.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mMay I? The documentation has a startupProbe.\u001b[39m\u001b[39X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mYou read the documentation?\u001b[39m\u001b[56X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAll of it.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m...\u001b[39m\u001b[80X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUntil startup says ready, liveness and readiness are not consulted at all.\u001b[39m         \r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mSo the start gets its own time budget?\u001b[39m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIts own. Two minutes if it wants. It does not affect the liveness"]
[0.000, "o", " period.\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd liveness goes back to what it was for. The initialDelay comes out, the\u001b[39m         \r\n        \u001b[37mperiod goes back to five.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[38;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mWARMUP_SECONDS  10 -> 20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe twenty is not mine. Timur put it on the cluster a minute ago and the file\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mstill said ten, so applying it would have quietly made the service fast again.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\u001b[42;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mwhat changes: 11-liveness-initialdelay.yaml -> 12-startup-probe.yaml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l  \u001b[2m[->]\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mclick to see the diff\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m. [s] skip . [q] quit\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
