[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA cold cache. A noisier neighbour. A bigger dataset. One more step at boot.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNone of those touch the manifest, and every one of them moves the start.\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery other number in a probe reacts to something the process did. This one only\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mcounts.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIt cannot tell a slow start from a dead process, because it is not looking.\u001b[39m        \r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mMay I? The documentation has a startupProbe.\u001b[39m\u001b[39X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mYou read the documentation?\u001b[39m\u001b[56X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAll of it.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37m...\u001b[39m\u001b[80X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUntil startup says ready, liveness and"]
[0.000, "o", " readiness are not consulted at all.\u001b[39m         \r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mSo the start gets its own time budget?\u001b[39m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mIts own. Two minutes if it wants. It does not affect the liveness period.\u001b[39m\u001b[10X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd liveness goes back to what it was for. The initialDelay comes out, the\u001b[39m         \r\n        \u001b[37mperiod goes back to five.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[16;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mWARMUP_SECONDS  10 -> 20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe twenty is not mine. Timur put it on the cluster a minute ago and the file\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mstill said ten, so applying it would have quietly made the service fast again.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\u001b[20;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mwhat changes: 11-liveness-initialdelay.yaml -> 12-startup-probe.yaml\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[36m@@ -26,5 +26,5 @@\u001b[39m spec:\u001b[78X\u001b[23;13H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cenv:\u001b[86X\u001b[24;15H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- name: WARMUP_SECONDS\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[31m-\u001b[14X"]
