[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m startup     has it finished booting?\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m liveness    is the process alive?      -> restart the container\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m readiness   can it serve right now?    -> out of the load balancer\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m While startup runs, the other two are not consulted at all.\u001b[40X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Its budget is its own: failureThreshold x period = 60 x 2 = 120s.\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Once it passes it is never consulted again.\u001b[56X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m So boot gets a deadline, and liveness goes back to asking about\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m steady state, which is what it was for.\u001b[60X\u001b[12;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m+ ready, zero restarts (22s)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[73X\u001b[14;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2msame slow start, RESTARTS still 0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[68X\r\n  \u001b[2mready \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . restarts \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[69X\r\n  \u001b[1m  1s\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m██████████████████████████████████"]
