[0.000, "o", " -> its address is removed, the rest carry the load.\u001b[29X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Every pod NotReady -> the slice is empty and the Service has nowhere\u001b[31X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[23X\u001b[23Cto send anything. No error, no traffic, no pods.\u001b[29X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m So the blast radius of a readiness probe is not one replica.\u001b[39X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m It is every replica that shares whatever the probe is asking about.\u001b[32X\u001b[27;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mThree replicas, probing every two seconds. One and a half scans per second.\u001b[39m\u001b[26X\u001b[30;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl exec -n demo deploy/dbshell -- sh -c \"psql \\\"\\$DSN\\\" -c \\\"SELECT count(*) AS conns,\u001b(B\u001b[m        \r\n    \u001b[36m\u001b[1mcount(*) FILTER (WHERE state='active') AS active, current_setting('max_connections') AS max FROM\u001b(B\u001b[m   \r\n    \u001b[36m\u001b[1mpg_stat_activity WHERE datname=current_database()\\\"\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47X\r\n   conns | active | max\u001b[80X\r\n  -------+--------+-----\u001b[79X\r\n      17 |      7 | 60\u001b[81X\r\n  (1 row)\u001b[94X\u001b[38;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[35m\u001b[1m(~_~) Postgres \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b"]
