[0.000, "o", "row)\u001b[94X\u001b[20;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[35m\u001b[1m(~_~) Postgres \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwelve connections out of fifty-four. I did not even wake up.\u001b[39m\u001b[22X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAll green. Zero incidents.\u001b[39m\u001b[57X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhile there are three replicas, yes.\u001b[39m\u001b[47X\u001b[24;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1m-> step 2.2: Black Friday: the queue fills\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[59X\u001b[26;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n  2.2 . Black Friday: the queue fills\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[66X\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mBlack Friday. The work arrives as a queue, which is what the whole system was built for.\u001b[39m\u001b[13X\u001b[32;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[36m\u001b[1m$ kubectl -n demo get scaledobject worker -o\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[57X\r\n    \u001b[36m\u001b[1mcustom-columns='NAME:.metadata.name,MIN:.spec.minReplicaCount,MAX:.spec.maxReplicaCount,TRI"]
[0.000, "o", "GGER:.sp\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\nec.triggers[*].type'\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[83X\r\n  NAME     MIN   MAX   TRIGGER\u001b[73X\r\n  worker   0     24    aws-sqs-queue\u001b[67X\u001b[38;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mKEDA watches the queue. Zero workers right now, because there is nothing to do.\u001b[39m\u001b[22X\u001b[40;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1mload starts\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mincident2-before\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m. enqueue . 20 rps for 90s\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[2mwatch the LOAD panel, bottom right\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[67X\r\n  \u001b[37mFilling the queue: two thousand messages a second going in.\u001b[39m\u001b[42X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
