[0.000, "o", "---------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mAll three add work to the database, and the database is where everyone is already stuck. The first\u001b[39m   \r\n  \u001b[37mone also buys more machines.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[37;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUnhook the probe from the database.\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA background goroutine does SELECT 1 every two seconds with a timeout and stores\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mthe result in a flag.\u001b[39m\u001b[74X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe probe reads the flag. That is all.\u001b[39m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd if the database really does go down?\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe flag goes stale and the pod honestly leaves the load balancer.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
