[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[33m\u001b[1m\u001b[2d  EVERYONE VOTE: what do you do first?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65X\u001b[33m\u001b[1m\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m . raise maxReplicaCount -- there are clearly not enough workers\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[1m2\u001b(B\u001b[m . restart the database -- it is slow\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[1m3\u001b(B\u001b[m . raise timeoutSeconds on the probe -- let it wait\u001b[49X\u001b[7;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1m-> step 2.4: Madina unhooks the probe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[64X\u001b[10;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n  2.4 . Madina unhooks the probe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[14;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  THE ANSWER: none of the three.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[71X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n---------------------------------"]
[0.000, "o", "----------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[19;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mAll three add work to the database, and the database is where everyone is already stuck. The first\u001b[39m   \r\n  \u001b[37mone also buys more machines.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[22;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mUnhook the probe from the database.\u001b[39m\u001b[48X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA background goroutine does SELECT 1 every two seconds with a timeout and stores\u001b[39m   \r\n        \u001b[37mthe result in a flag.\u001b[39m\u001b[74X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe probe reads the flag. That is all.\u001b[39m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd if the database really does go down?\u001b[39m\u001b[43X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mThe flag goes stale and the pod honestly leaves the load balancer.\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAll twenty-four at once?\u001b[39m\u001b[59X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne at a "]
[0.000, "o", "time, as each flag expires. And the database gets not one extra query.\u001b[39m    \u001b[31;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[37mThe probe now costs O(1). Twenty-four replicas or two hundred and forty, it is the same.\u001b[39m\u001b[13X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo more things. The pool is budgeted against the wall: three connections, not\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mfour.\u001b[39m\u001b[90X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd KEDA gets a ceiling. An autoscaler without one is a way to turn an incident\u001b[39m    \r\n        \u001b[37minto an invoice.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\u001b[37;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mREADY_MODE  db_each_call -> cached\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mA goroutine does SELECT 1 on its own schedule and stores the answer. The probe\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mreads the flag, so the cost stops multiplying by replicas.\u001b[39m\u001b[37X\u001b[41;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1mapp change\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[1mPOOL_MAX  4 -> 3\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[73X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAnd the pool is budgeted agains"]
[0.000, "o", "t max_connections rather than against nothing.\u001b[39m      \u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
