[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina's notes\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1m. THE FIX, IN THREE PARTS\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[55X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 1  The probe reads a flag, not the database. A goroutine refreshes\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    the flag on its own schedule, so the cost is O(1) in replicas\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    instead of O(n) -- and a stale flag still takes the pod out.\u001b[36X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 2  The pool is budgeted against the wall: replicas x POOL_MAX has\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    to stay under max_connections, with room for everything else.\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m 3  maxReplicaCount is 12, not 24. An autoscaler without a ceiling\u001b[34X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m    is a way to turn an incident into an invoice.\u001b[51X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Only the first one is about probes. The other two decide how far\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m the next mistake gets before something stops it.\u001b[51X\u001b[16;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1mSame queue, same database, same cluster.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[61X\u001b[19;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1mload starts\u001b(B\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m  \u001b[1mincident2-after\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m. enqueue . 20 rps for 90s\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[46X\r\n  \u001b[2mwatch the LOAD panel, bottom right\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[67X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mTwo things, while this runs. The workers column, and the node count.\u001b[39m\u001b[15X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mEvery worker that comes up should go Ready and stay Ready. And the node count\u001b[39m      \r\n        \u001b[37mshould not move.\u001b[39m\u001b[79X\r\n  \u001b[37mThe queue will not go down: two thousand a second go in, and twelve workers cannot outrun that.\u001b[39m      \r\n  \u001b[37mWatch the other two numbers.\u001b[39m\u001b[73X\u001b[27;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mevery worker Ready, node count flat\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[66X\r\n  \u001b[2mqueue \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m202503/24\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . workers \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m12/12\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m . nodes \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m4\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m ~$0.07/h\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[51X\r\n  \u001b[1m  8s\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m███████████████████████████████████████████████\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m░░░░░\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[2mlet it run . [->] skips\u001b("]
[0.000, "o", "B\u001b[m\u001b[18X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-7zhw9        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-8nrpn        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-8x44g        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-jmm79        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-jv6bx        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-l9qw7        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-m542v        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-nbmmc        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-nps5v        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-pbx28        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-qrt6b        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\r\n  worker-7b7c9b974c-rldlg        \u001b[32m\u001b[1m1/1\u001b(B\u001b[m  Running\u001b[10X\u001b[10CR:0\u001b[45X\u001b[43;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
